# Account Determination aset tetap (OADT) lewat Service Layer, entity FAAccountDeterminations.
# Sumber: daftar 10 determination dari user (2026-10-16). 6 sudah ada & identik (INV-BANGUNAN, INV-KENDARAAN, INV-LEASEHOLD,
# INV-MESIN, INV-PRLTNKANTOR, TANAH) di-skip. Sudah dijalankan di CVPPM (QA): 4x HTTP 201, dicek ulang 10/10 sama.

@sl = https://192.168.40.197:50000/b1s/v1

### 1. Login
POST {{sl}}/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{"CompanyDB":"CVPPM","UserName":"manager","Password":"1234"}

### 2. Cek yang sudah ada
GET {{sl}}/FAAccountDeterminations?$select=Code,Description,AssetBalanceSheetAccount,OrdinaryDepreciation,AccumulatedOrdinaryDepr

### 3. Tambah INV-LOWVALASST (hasil benar: HTTP 201)
POST {{sl}}/FAAccountDeterminations
Content-Type: application/json

{"Code": "INV-LOWVALASST", "Description": "INVENTARIS LOW VALUE ASSET", "AssetBalanceSheetAccount": "102010109", "ClearingAccountAcquisition": "102030101", "RevaluationReserveAccount": "102010109", "OrdinaryDepreciation": "603060108", "AccumulatedOrdinaryDepr": "102020108", "UnplannedDepreciation": "603060108", "AccumulatedUnplannedDepr": "102020108", "SpecialDepreciation": "603060108", "AccumulatedSpecialDepr": "102020108", "RevenuefromAssetSalesNet": "701030101", "RetirementwithExpenseNet": "702020101", "RetirementwithRevenueNet": "701030101", "LeavewithExpenseNBVGross": "702020101", "LeavewithRevenueNBVGross": "701030101", "RevenueAccountforRetirement": "701030101", "RevenueClearingAccount": "102030101", "RevaluationReserveClearing": "102030101", "RevaluationAccount": "102010109"}

